0..76 Comment "// Univalence over the user universe at a stratum code: `ua[1, 4]` makes the"
77..151 Comment "// magma\'s degree telescope a path in `Type` (`ua-by-hand.gandr`), and the"
152..227 Comment "// statement `univalence` makes over any two types holds at it, as does the"
228..306 Comment "// packaging `idtoequiv` of that path. Transport along `ua` of a packaged path"
307..347 Comment "// is the path\'s transport at every path"
348..426 Comment "// (`../identity/univalence-transports.gandr`); the path between the two paths"
427..492 Comment "// is owed (`pathological/identity/univalence-owed.gandr`, #520)."
494..541 Comment "// The magma, the swap and the unit\'s identity."
